    "text": ":rotating_light: OLake Fusion v0.2.2 Released:rotating_light:\nRelease: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/releases/tag/v0.2.2|github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/…/v0.2.2\u003e\n*What’s New*\n• feat(telemetry): classify and report catalog and table sync failures by \u003c@U0C510Q1PQC\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/78|#78\u003e\n• feat(telemetry): report optimizer startup failures by \u003c@U0C510Q1PQC\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/79|#79\u003e\n• feat: fusion nfs removal by \u003c@U0BF1NS2UJ0\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/51|#51\u003e\n• feat(telemetry): report compaction and table maintenance failures by \u003c@U0C510Q1PQC\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/82|#82\u003e\n• chore(optimizer): log executor memory and overhead requirements by \u003c@U0C510Q1PQC\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/100|#100\u003e\n• fix: iceberg v3 tables fail the run instead of being rejected by \u003c@U0BF1NS2UJ0\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/106|#106\u003e\n• feat(logs): nfs to s3 by \u003c@U0BF1NS2UJ0\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/105|#105\u003e (Works with helm chart \u0026gt;= \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/releases/tag/olake-0.0.37|olake-0.0.37\u003e)\n:rotating_light: OLake Worker v0.5.2 Released:rotating_light:\nRelease: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/releases/tag/v0.5.2|github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/…/v0.5.2\u003e\n*What’s New*\n• fix(worker): bump Go to 1.26.11 for GO-2026-6859 by \u003c@U082APQJZNC\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/pull/277|#277\u003e\n:rotating_light: OLake Helm v0.0.37 Released:rotating_light:\n:link: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/releases/tag/olake-0.0.37|github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/…/olake-0.0.37\u003e\n:rocket: Features \u0026amp; Fixes in this release:\n• chore: adding s3 upload in fusion by \u003c@U0817E9CGRM\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/pull/282|#282\u003e\n• feat(helm): add extraVolumes for olake-ui and olake-worker by \u003c@U0BMJKKJ694\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/pull/279|#279\u003e\nThanks for the contribution!",
